lord tarrant~
Lord Tarrant~
A thin, haggard figure strides forth from the darkness.
~
   The soul of Lord Tarrant was cursed by the witch to be bound to this plane,
and has in its rage become a revenant, thirsting for vengeance.  Were Tarrant
to know the witch to be slain, he could at last rest, with the rest of his
kinfolk.  A mighty sorcerer as well as a formidable swordsman, Tarrant is a foe
worthy of respect for any perpetrator of evil deeds.    
~
