black dragon dengraz'ch~
Dengraz'ch~
An enormous black dragon lies curled up in the cave.
~
   Dengraz'ch is a formidable drake, one of the many terrors inflicted on the
hapless village of Gilchrist by the Necromancer.  He answers to none but The
Necromancer, not even to the witch or her cabal, who hate and fear him.  While
he is of unfathomable evil, he is not overtly violent, and will not attack
obviously capable adventurers without provocation- past experience has taught
him not to underestimate these disarmingly frail-looking creatures.    
~
